		top: 50%;
		left: 50%;
		width: 20rpx;
		height: 3rpx;
		background: #FFFFFF;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);
	}

	.search-clear:after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
